<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Prudential starts steel cos as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Prudential starts steel cos as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities started coverage of six steel companies, all with buy ratings, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Newly-rated companies include USX-U.S. Steel Group, Ryerson Tull Inc, AK Steel Holding Corp, Commercial Metals Co, LTV Corp and Inland Steel Resources Inc.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
